# Title: Security Software Discovery - MacOs
# ID: 0ed75b9c-c73b-424d-9e7d-496cd565fbe0
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Daniil Yugoslavskiy, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-19
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1518.001
# Description: Detects usage of system utilities (only grep for now) to discover security software discovery
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((Image:"/usr/bin/grep") AND (((CommandLine:*nessusd* OR CommandLine:*santad* OR CommandLine:*CbDefense* OR CommandLine:*falcond* OR CommandLine:*td-agent* OR CommandLine:*packetbeat* OR CommandLine:*filebeat* OR CommandLine:*auditbeat* OR CommandLine:*osqueryd* OR CommandLine:*BlockBlock* OR CommandLine:*LuLu*)) OR ((CommandLine:*Little* AND CommandLine:*Snitch*))))
